type: software
title: "BluePort AI: waste classification for ports using computer vision (CLIP)"
abstract: "A privacy-first Telegram bot that classifies waste from photos using a frozen CLIP (ViT-B/32) encoder with a lightweight linear probe, reaching about 95% accuracy across six categories and running entirely offline."
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-15"
license: MIT
